        },
        {
          "name": "In Old Page Index",
          "type": "UInt"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Bool",
      "docs": "Sets the current page to the one specified by the index. If the page does not exist, creates a new page.\nThe page will move to index 0.\n@param\tInTitle\t\tThe title of the page to search for, or create\n@param\tInMaxPages\tThe maximum number of pages we keep around. If the count is exceeded,\nwe discard the oldest page.\n@returns true if the page has changed (either switched or created a new one)."
